-    The only exceptions for which process identity is pre-emptively
-    checked and guaranteed are:
-
-     - parent()
-     - children()
-     - nice() (set)
-     - ionice() (set)
-     - rlimit() (set)
-     - cpu_affinity (set)
-     - suspend()
-     - resume()
-     - send_signal()
-     - terminate()
-     - kill()
